      "title": "Workaround for audit log gaps during retention policy application",
      "content_summary": "Guidance on handling missing audit log entries when applying retention policies, caused by a known product limitation in Deploy Manager.",
      "content_body": "Audit log gaps can occur in Deploy Manager when a retention policy is applied to a large data set, as the system may not write all entries synchronously. This is a known limitation of the current version. Until the fix is released, enable verbose logging on the OAuth Service to capture the missing entries, and use the 'force-sync' command to reconcile the audit logs after the policy update completes."
